\description{
The generalized drift-diffusion model of Shinn, Lam and Murray (2020).
Evidence accumulates between two decision boundaries and the response
time is the first time it reaches one, as in \code{\link[=wiener]{wiener()}}; unlike
\code{\link[=wiener]{wiener()}}, the drift may depend on the state of the accumulator and on
